@host = http://localhost:8081
@apiKey = substitua-pela-api-key
@accessToken = cole-o-access_token-retornado-no-login
@userId = cole-o-id-do-usuario

### Login (guarde os cookies retornados)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "email": "usuario@example.com",
  "password": "SenhaAtual123"
}

### Alterar a própria senha (usuário identificado pelo token)
PUT {{host}}/user/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Cookie: access_token={{accessToken}}

{
  "newPassword": "SenhaNova123"
}

### Redefinir a senha de outro usuário (somente Admin)
PUT {{host}}/user/admin/{{userId}}/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Cookie: access_token={{accessToken}}

{
  "newPassword": "SenhaNova123"
}

# Equivalentes em curl
#
# curl -i -X PUT "http://localhost:8081/user/me/password" \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -H "X-Api-Key: $API_KEY" \
#   -H "Cookie: access_token=$ACCESS_TOKEN" \
#   -d '{"newPassword":"SenhaNova123"}'
#
# curl -i -X PUT "http://localhost:8081/user/admin/$USER_ID/password" \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -H "X-Api-Key: $API_KEY" \
#   -H "Cookie: access_token=$ACCESS_TOKEN" \
#   -d '{"newPassword":"SenhaNova123"}'
